# panel fixture: the VEL knob turned counter-clockwise lowers the velocity offset, which may be negative
# manual: p015
# workflow: Step zoom, step attributes
# p015: "The step velocity offset may be a positive or negative number."
given step 3 5 vel = 2
at 0 ms press mode.step
at 200 ms click step(3,5)
at 400 ms release mode.step
at 1000 ms turn edit.enc.vel -5
expect command SetStep track=3 step=4 attr=VelocityOffset value=-3
expect commands 1
expect engine step 3 5 vel = -3
